# ============================================================================
# Coffin-Reborn  —  MPLAB X + Harmony (MCC Melody) / XC32 / SAME51J20A
#
# Tracked  : source (src/), MCC/Harmony config (*.mc4, components/*.yml,
#            mcc-manifest-*.yml) and MPLAB project files (nbproject/*.xml,
#            Makefile-*.mk).
# Ignored  : everything the toolchain regenerates on build.
# ============================================================================

# --- MCC & Harmony backups ---
*.bak*

# --- MPLAB X / XC32 build output ---
build/
dist/
debug/
cmake/
_build/
.generated_files/
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.hex
*.map

# --- MPLAB X machine-local settings (contain absolute C:\Users\... paths) ---
# **/ so they match under CR-Proj/, not just the repo root.
**/nbproject/private/
**/nbproject/Makefile-local-*
**/nbproject/Package-*.bash

# --- MPLAB trace logs ---
*.log
*.log.inx

.generated_files/
build/
dist/
nbproject/
Makefile*
Package-*
private/
_build/
!cmake/**/user.cmake
cmake/**/.generated/*
cmake/**/CMake*
out/
backups/

out/